{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1428494-the-library-of-the-damned-a-supplement-for-vampire-the-dark-ages","id":1428494,"title":"The Library of the Damned - A Supplement for Vampire: the Dark Ages","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-15T11:22:06-08:00","id":1428494,"title":"The Library of the Damned - A Supplement for Vampire: the Dark Ages","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><img src=\"https://dtrpg-public-files.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/images/1/340024-thumb140.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>A Collection of Forbidden Knowledge</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">For as long as they have existed, the Children of Caine have kept records of their history and unnatural condition. The books they have created provide a detailed record of all aspects of Cainite history and society, from the time of the First City, to the bloody conflicts of recent nights. These are dangerous texts; not only must they be hidden from mortal eyes, but they also contain forbidden lore, material which many elders would prefer to be forgotten. The dangerous, radical, and even heretical, notions found within these books are feared by many, and with good reason. There are few who would dare to delve within the library of the damned.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Cursed Literature</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>The Library of the Damned </i>is a sourcebook for <i>Vampire: the Dark Ages</i>, describing the key works of literature created by Cainites. This supplement contains material on various books authored by the damned, from the eerie mythology of the <i>Book of Nod</i>, to the dark heresies of the <i>Euagetaematikon</i>. Accompanying the descriptions of such works are rules and systems to allow players and Storytellers to incorporate this material into their chronicles.<br /> <br /> The Library of the Damned is now available for purchase at the <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/340024/The-Library-of-the-Damned\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Vault</a>.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/317-james_willoughby","name":"James_Willoughby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar317_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-15T19:40:11-08:00","id":1428546,"title":"","content":"Once again Sir, you never cease to amaze. I salute you...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2582-gangrel44","name":"Gangrel44","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-17T01:44:39-08:00","id":1428721,"title":"","content":"3rd book and still as well written. Still very rich in co